{#
  /therapy, the "who we help" section landing. A ROUTING page, not a content page:
  its job is to get someone to the right child page quickly, so it keeps to the
  lean key set COMPONENT_COVERAGE.md specifies for section landings (hero, lead,
  grid, cta) and deliberately carries no FAQ, no support block and no Service
  schema. Depth belongs to the six children (SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md: "One page, one
  job. Depth beats breadth.").

  BRIEF: SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md had no per-page brief and no sitemap row for this
  URL when it was built, so the title, meta and H1 here were authored to house
  convention and then written back into SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md. Keywording targets
  broad hub terms only. Every named cluster in the SEO baseline (panic/phobia,
  premarital, senior, grief) is explicitly assigned to a CHILD page, so this page
  must not compete with them.

  WHY THE GRID IS NOT THE `next:` FRONT-MATTER KEY: a routing page must never link
  a page that does not exist. Building the cards here from nav.json, filtered on
  `published`, makes that structurally impossible and keeps the grid in step with
  the menu forever. The same array feeds the ItemList schema, so the two cannot
  drift. This is the pattern already shipped on the homepage. Only the card copy
  lives in this file.

  NOTE the `lead` macro escapes its text, so the cross-link to /specialties is a
  pill link below rather than inline prose.

  Gold discipline: the hero CTA stays navy (no hero.gold); the single gold action
  is the closing ctaBand. No em dashes.
#}
{% import "components/sections.njk" as s %}

{% set therapyCopy = {
  "/therapy/individuals": { icon: "compass", body: "You already know what you would do differently. The gap between knowing it and doing it is usually where the real work begins." },
  "/therapy/children": { icon: "sun", body: "Warm, developmentally-attuned counseling for young children, indoors with play and stories or outdoors on the sand." },
  "/therapy/couples": { icon: "heart", body: "For the slow disconnection, the argument on repeat, and the fresh start before a wedding. Pro-commitment, never pro-pressure." },
  "/therapy/teens": { icon: "chat", body: "A low-pressure way in for a teenager who did not ask to be here, and steady footing for the parents alongside them." },
  "/therapy/families": { icon: "shell", body: "When the whole household is stuck, no single person can unstick it alone. We work with the system, not against one member of it." },
  "/therapy/seniors": { icon: "clock", body: "Grief, retirement, and later-life change, from the founder of the Heart to Heart program at Susi Q." }
} %}

{# Growth priority first (SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md weights individuals and children),
   then the rest in nav.json order. #}
{% set priority = ["/therapy/individuals", "/therapy/children"] %}
{% set ordered = [] %}
{% for url in priority %}
  {% for child in nav.sections.therapy.children %}
    {% if child.published and child.url == url %}{% set _ = ordered.push(child) %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% for child in nav.sections.therapy.children %}
  {% if child.published and child.url not in priority %}{% set _ = ordered.push(child) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% set cards = [] %}
{% for child in ordered %}
  {% set copy = therapyCopy[child.url] %}
  {% set _ = cards.push({ icon: copy.icon, title: child.label, body: copy.body, href: child.url, linkLabel: child.label }) %}
{% endfor %}

{{ s.pointCards({
  tone: "sand",
  columns: 3,
  eyebrow: "Start here",
  title: "Six ways in, depending on who is coming",
  cards: cards
}) }}

{{ s.pillLinks({
  tone: "paper",
  eyebrow: "The other door",
  title: "Or start from what is going on",
  lead: "If you would rather begin with the struggle than the label, the specialties pages are organized that way.",
  links: [
    { href: "/specialties", label: "What people struggle with" },
    { href: "/beach-therapy", label: "Beach Therapy" },
    { href: "/telehealth", label: "Online therapy in California" },
    { href: "/fees", label: "Fees and insurance" }
  ]
}) }}

{{ s.itemListSchema({
  name: "Therapy services at Laguna Beach Counseling",
  description: "The audience pages at Laguna Beach Counseling, organized by who the therapy is for.",
  url: page.url,
  baseUrl: site.url,
  items: ordered
}) }}
